collected on 2026-10-08 · self-declared</div></td></tr></table></div><p class="herkunft">What is measured is what a manifest declares, not what a piece of software does. This registry fetches no repository URL, no endpoint and no package index; nothing here is verified. Which value comes from which source, and by which rule it was formed, is set out in the <a href="/methodik">Methodology</a>.</p></section>
